            Explore {totalTopics}+ specialized course topics with {totalCourses}+ premium Udemy courses. From Python programming to AI, find expert-led courses with exclusive deals.
          </p>

          {/* Statistics Badges */}
          <div style={{
            display: "flex",
            justifyContent: "center",
            gap: "1rem",
            flexWrap: "wrap",
            marginBottom: "3rem"
          }}>
            <div style={{
              display: "flex",
